{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e03c92bd400124e82cecfabbbe0d738eca2d68c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1}{x} - \\frac {1}{y} = \\frac {1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46c53b9fa245e1569818411bed81297de3970aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y - x\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x - y\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac {y - x}{xy}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac {xy}{y - x}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac {xy}{x - y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"528\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/27706635ccc9e437de2ff4a15e524c46dc3f45d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc2d7a1278d53e9194e6cef05027ff42adceafa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{xy}-\\frac{x}{xy}=\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a951f350c41454b0396f92f5d23b554cbfcaab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y-x}{xy}=\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68b08576f077e6ad5192f751a2f2dea7f896b31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\frac{y-x}{xy}}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{z}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"70\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf38456057ba4368b66c3a2ea4f60ed36107e47d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{xy}{y-x}=z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"79\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>The answer is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" ali